  "details": "When VRChat opens, it requires the client has the same GPU for monitors as there is for the VR Headset. This is problematic because other games works perfectly fine without it.\nYou might be thinking this is no big deal, let me tell you why it is.\nI bought a new GPU to play VR with, but I can't have my VR headset plugged into it when playing VRChat, because my main monitors are not connected to this GPU, because they are not compatible. The user should not switch hardware around to  specifically make VRChat work.",
